---
import SectionHeading from "../shared/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="No Two Journeys Are the Same"
      headline="The goal isn't to repeat the same solution."
      subhead="It's to repeat the process of finding what works."
    />
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-600">
      One business may need a clearer path to conversion. Another may need a
      stronger acquisition strategy. Another may have the right pieces in place
      but no reliable way to connect and measure them. The work changes because
      the constraint changes. What stays consistent is the process: diagnose the
      problem, build what it calls for, measure the result, and improve from
      there.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
